  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-332835\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's sketch the trajectory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We start at the given point and go along with the flow (upward and slightly to the left) until the trajectory intersects the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"209\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-nullcline, where the tangents are vertical.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-251ed21b9c7ceed8abae00a16edb210f\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/251ed21b9c7ceed8abae00a16edb210f\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Next, the flow continues going upward but then turns to the right.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-1d5521b7252bcc6e04bd56653bc978be\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/1d5521b7252bcc6e04bd56653bc978be\"></div>  \n\n<ul>\n<li>After that, the trajectory goes to the right and slightly upward to infinity.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-cc8713f94ac77f4a2f006df4a5c5e3c2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/cc8713f94ac77f4a2f006df4a5c5e3c2\"></div>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-332835-a-3\">\n</div></div>",
